'''Bitter Irony''' is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]] and appears every Sunday. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Hoop Cat (Rare Cat)|Hoop Cat]]: Hoopmaster Cat.

